ine bottles]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"section3-right\">\n    <h2>Symptoms of active TB disease:</h2>\n    <div class=\"symptoms-grid\">\n      <div class=\"symptom-item\">\n        <div class=\"symptom-icon placeholder\" style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#f0f0f0;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:36px;\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"symptom-label\">Cough lasting<br>3+ weeks</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"symptom-item\">\n        <div class=\"symptom-icon placeholder\" style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#f0f0f0;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:36px;\">🤧</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"symptom-label\">Coughing up blood or sputum<br><em>(phlegm from deep inside the lungs)</em></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"symptom-item\">\n        <div class=\"symptom-icon placeholder\" style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#f0f0f0;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:36px;\">😣</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"symptom-label\">Chest pain</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"symptom-item\">\n        <div class=\"symptom-icon placeholder\" style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#f0f0f0;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:36px;\">😩</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"symptom-label\">Weakness<br>or fatigue</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"symptom-item\">\n        <div class=\"symptom-icon placeholder\" style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#f0f0f0;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:36px;\">🤢</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"symptom-label\">No appetite</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"symptom-item\">\n        <div class=\"symptom-icon placeholder\" style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#f0f0f0;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:36px;\">⚖️</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"symptom-label\">Weight loss</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"symptom-item\">\n        <div class=\"symptom-icon placeholder\" style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#